<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 70-1 AT LUNCH AGAINST N.TVL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 70-1 AT LUNCH AGAINST N.TVL.</headline>
<dateline>CENTURION 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal were 70 for one from 19 overs at lunch on the opening day of the four-day Supersport Series match at Centurion Park.</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal put Natal into bat and play began at 11:30 a.m. because of overnight rain.</p>
